{"id":120362024,"slug":"william-osler-md-for-psychedelic","title":"William Osler, M.D. for Psychedelic Medicine Key Opinion Leader","subtitle":"Boring is the new revolution.","post_date":"2023-06-07T14:53:51.090Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/william-osler-md-for-psychedelic","wordcount":631,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:59:05.058Z","body_sha256":"d17793b51d4e3b2fed578d9aae2233af786ae64ca2e7d046337e7a706176410a","text_words":772,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Dear readers, the potential of innovative technology is here, and we need to downplay it.  In keeping with my ongoing advocacy for “the rules,” I draft this missive.</p><p>I welcome Everyone in <strong>All Psychedelic Medicine Related Endeavors</strong> to this newsletter so they can take my excellent advice.*</p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/william-osler-md-for-psychedelic?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thank you for reading The Frontier Psychiatrists. This post is public, so feel free to share it.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/william-osler-md-for-psychedelic?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/william-osler-md-for-psychedelic?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p><em>* this advice has not been vetted for excellence.</em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Za-K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1873\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/27b3abf2-ee14-4ea8-b2cc-18cd33259497_2629x3382.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1873,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2886220,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;h