0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The dead father of modern medicine, William Osler.</figcaption></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/dear-psychedelic-medicine-congrats?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">I wrote an article recently.</a>  It was about the necessity of boringness in psychedelics.</p><p></p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:119069503,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dear-psychedelic-medicine-congrats&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:355550,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F997b8496-9b4d-43c2-b393-6f8a77945b00_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Dear Psychedelic Medicine: Congrats on Your AMA CPT Codes! Now, Get More Boring&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;Hi there, this is a column about my concerns with the progress of psychedelic medicine towards becoming just medicine. The American Medical Association owns the current procedural terminology (CPT) code system (a trademark of the AMA). That is right, every time there is a bill submitted in healthcare, the intellectual property around the sequence of letters and numbers that describe that medical procedure? It is the is the property of the AMA. And this week,&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2023-05-04T02:56:07.242Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:5,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:2277375,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Owen Scott Muir, M.D&quot;,&quot;handle&quot;:&quot;psychiatrist&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:&quot;O. Scott Muir, M.D&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1c03f44d-4506-4843-989f-0d38e66c6946_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Dr. Owen Scott Muir is a healthcare innovator and entrepreneur, working across innovative care, payment models, technology, regulatory compliance, and education. He's a graduate of Amherst College.&quot;,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2022-06-28T02:49:31.393Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:303814,&quot;user_id&quot;:2277375,&quot;publication_id&quot;:355550,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;,&quot;public&quot;:true,&quot;is_primary&quot;:true,&quot;publication&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:355550,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;thefrontierpsychiatrists&quot;,&quot;custom_domain&quot;:null,&quot;custom_domain_optional&quot;:false,&quot;hero_text&quot;:&quot;Owen Scott Muir, M.D. writes things about health and its care.&quot;,&quot;logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/997b8496-9b4d-43c2-b393-6f8a77945b00_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;author_id&quot;:36402150,&quot;theme_var_background_pop&quot;:&quot;#8AE1A2&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2021-05-06T16:38:31.660Z&quot;,&quot;rss_website_url&quot;:null,&quot;email_from_name&quot;:&quot;FrontierPsych&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists&quot;,&quot;founding_plan_name&quot;:&quot;Inner Circle Members&quot;,&quot;community_enabled&quot;:false,&quot;invite_only&quot;:false,&quot;payments_state&quot;:&quot;enabled&quot;}}],&quot;twitter_screen_name&quot;:&quot;ScottMuirMD&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dear-psychedelic-medicine-congrats?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oO3w!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F997b8496-9b4d-43c2-b393-6f8a77945b00_1080x1080.png\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">Dear Psychedelic Medicine: Congrats on Your AMA CPT Codes! Now, Get More Boring</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Hi there, this is a column about my concerns with the progress of psychedelic medicine towards becoming just medicine. The American Medical Association owns the current procedural terminology (CPT) code system (a trademark of the AMA). That is right, every time there is a bill submitted in healthcare, the intellectual property around the sequence of letters and numbers that describe that medical procedure? It is the is the property of the AMA. And this week…</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">3 years ago · 5 likes · Owen Scott Muir, M.D</div></a></div><p>This <em>specific advice</em> is about <strong>novel interventions in medicine.</strong> Getting them firmly ensconced in the mainstream is the way to prevent the haters from destroying the revolution <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timothy_Leary\">all over again.</a></p><p>To be very clear, there is <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7736164/#:~:text=The%20mean%20effect%20size%20for,therapy%20was%20Hedges%20g%20%3D%201.22.\">no need to hype psychedelic medicines’ potential</a>.  These drugs, as I mentioned, create <strong><a href=\"https://lonerwolf.com/mystical-experience/\">mystical experiences</a></strong>—a profound belief in something greater than one’s self.  No one needs to tell anyone how great it will be. <em>The drugs do that themselves</em>.  The counterculture?  It feels like a board complaint waiting to happen. The House of Medicine only wants to hear from the most culturally bounded institutions. </p><p>Physicians promptly interrupt patients in medical encounters.  We don't get <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6816596/\">past 11 seconds</a>.  Doctor-splaining is like Mansplaining, absent any words slipped in edgewise.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg\" width=\"422\" height=\"414.615\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1179,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:422,&quot;bytes&quot;:101681,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dtLB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F62df1ed3-6292-44af-bad4-86e9c73c9695_1200x1179.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Look at how <em>established</em> that dead man is!</figcaption></figure></div><p>I am introducing my proposed Key Opinion Leader: Doctor <strong>William Osler. </strong> Resurrect that dude.  Keynote speaker.  That is what appeals to the institutions that physicians look to for guidance.  It would be comforting if he could have consulted for Eli Lilly, Novartis, and Pfizer and had a long list of related disclosures.   Listen to how <em>established</em> Osler is:</p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>\"I have had but two ambitions in the profession: first, to make of myself a good clinical physician, to be ranked with the men who have done so much for the profession of this country . . . My second ambition has been to build up a great clinic …on lines that have proved so successful on the Continent, and which have placed the scientific medicine…in the forefront of the world.</p><p>—Bill Osler, M.D.</p></div><p>What follows is an email about an upcoming conference.  It’s… off key.  It drops the F-bomb.  F…un.  Cringe!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg\" width=\"548\" height=\"844.5147286821706\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1988,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:548,&quot;bytes&quot;:859910,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E7VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F497fc594-9ba3-49d2-a187-d522b8a577b5_1290x1988.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Screenshot of “Fun” Being advertised at Science Meeting.</figcaption></figure></div><p><strong>Don’t</strong>: Explore Fun.  It’s not dignified.</p><p><strong>Do</strong>: Embed Osler's resurrection in Apple Vision Pro.  The only <em>fun</em> that matters will have a somber, defensible go-to-market strategy with a proven history of execution and an extremely conservative approach to regulatory compliance. Could there be well-executed stickers?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f6mk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg\" width=\"490\" height=\"822.7441860465116\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5cda233a-9753-462f-aa99-584673990b2a_1290x2166.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&q